Local copies, so nothing depends on the upstream staying online.  The contents are git-ignored
(they are large); back this directory up.

  src/NAME.git      the simulator source trees, one bare repository per simh.json source
                    (./build-simh fills it, and builds from it when the upstream is gone)
  images/           every image and tape ./fetch downloaded, as it came (TO--FILENAME)
  built/            the disk images prebsd made itself from tapes (pdp10/install-ki.sh, the
                    V7 and 32V installs), with their SHA256SUMS; they take hours to make

PREBSD_MIRROR=/other/path moves it.
